      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "        \n通过这种方法，可以创建master&slaver的形态\nfor ranks in group_ranks:\n    device_group = torch.distributed.new_group(\n                ranks, backend=torch_distributed_backend\n            )",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "        \n通过这种方法，可以创建master&slaver的形态\nfor ranks in group_ranks:\n    device_group = torch.distributed.new_group(\n                ranks, backend=torch_distributed_backend\n            )",
